msgstr "Vous devez gagner sans tarder la capsule de secours! \\nSuivez-moi!\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_040"
msgid ""
"You can't make accusations like that without evidence.\\n I assume that you "
"have some?\\n"
msgstr ""
"Avez-vous des preuves pour avancer de tels propos?\\n Vos accusations sont "
"très graves.\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_041"
msgid ""
"This is a recording of a meeting between \\nTrent and the other "
"conspirators.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Voici l'enregistrement de la réunion entre \\nTrent et ses sbires "
"conspirateurs.\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_042"
msgid "Seems overwhelming... I'm in your hands. \\nWhat do we do now?\\n"
msgstr "C'est effrayant... Je vous crois. \\nQue fait-on maintenant?\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_043"
msgid "Hey, that's not...\\n"
msgstr "Hé, ce n'est pas...\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_044"
